# Signoff project intelligence

- UI language is English; chat with the user in Roman Urdu, short.
- Never touch Docker files.
- Internal notes on client/project/agreement must never appear on public or client agreement payloads.
- Signed agreement versions are immutable; additional work uses change requests.
- Email is stubbed via EmailService; swap implementation later without changing callers.
- Swagger lives at /api/docs. Share endpoints + sample responses when a flow is done.
- Favicon/icon is the teal document+check mark in app/icon.svg.
- Database is MongoDB at mongodb://localhost:27017/signoff via Prisma.
- Client portal uses ClientShell (light header, no admin sidebar). Home is /agreements. History is client-scoped via GET /api/history.
